
# read in mesh 1 
read / middle_layer.inp / mo_middle

pset / pfrac / attribute imt / 1 0 0 / eq / 2
cmo / setatt / mo_middle / imt / pset, get, pfrac / 5
 pset / pfrac / delete

pset / pfrac / attribute imt / 1 0 0 / eq / 1
cmo / setatt / mo_middle / imt / pset, get, pfrac / 4
 pset / pfrac / delete

dump / middle_layer_shift.inp / mo_middle 
